Manage switchover pairs.

Usage:
  confluent switchover pair [command]

Available Commands:
  create         Create a switchover pair.
  delete         Delete one or more switchover pairs.
  describe       Describe a switchover pair.
  list           List switchover pairs.
  trigger-switch Trigger a failover or switchback on a switchover pair.
  update         Update a switchover pair.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent switchover pair [command] --help" for more information about a command.
